# The same race scrubbing with two powerslides (11.97 s): Kevin from Three Bin (11.16 s) and the
# Dolores Park DJ (11.48 s) come past after the slides; you are third of four, the Night-shift nurse
# behind you (she was third in 11.51 s, you fourth, until city phase 11 moved the curbs once; third
# before the city's sweep fixes, city phase 8, laid the parked cars out again). racerFinish carries each local's place and time; bombFinish your place.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run bomb
hold up 20..200
hold ollie 200..2400
hold slide 1220..1290
hold slide 1560..1630
run 1760
expect session.racePlace == 1 at 1200
expect session.racePlace == 2 at 1400
expect session.racePlace == 3 at 1600
expect event racerFinish{route=dolores,name=Kevin from Three Bin,place=1,time=11.16} within 1595..1610
expect event racerFinish{name=Dolores Park DJ,place=2,time=11.48} within 1633..1648
expect no event racerFinish{name=Night-shift nurse} within 0..1697
expect event bombFinish{route=dolores,place=3,of=4,time=11.97} within 1690..1705
